WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.239 --> 00:00:02.739
(light music)

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.833
- Strange time to practice.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.930
But better late than never.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.740
I swear, I'm not a stalker.

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.390
I just really had to talk to you.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:27.710
- How'd you find me?

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:30.720
- Do you even have to ask?

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.900
- Elsa tracks my phone.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:42.560
- First off, it sucks you're avoiding me.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.480
I put myself out there

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.316
and I was honest with you.

00:00:51.316 --> 00:00:53.783
And for that, I get the silent treatment?

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.730
Even if you don't feel the same,

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:01.800
you could at least be
there for me as a friend.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.853
You're making me feel crazy.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:12.700
Honestly, if I knew that
you were gonna be all weird

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.630
and that this was gonna
jeopardize our friendship,

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.110
I never in a million years
would've told you how I felt.

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:22.430
Because it is becoming incredibly clear

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:24.080
that you don't feel the same way.

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:38.511
("I Think We're Alone Now")

00:01:43.112 --> 00:01:47.049
♪ Children behave ♪

00:01:47.049 --> 00:01:51.086
♪ That's what they say
when we're together ♪

00:01:51.086 --> 00:01:54.989
♪ Watch how you play ♪

00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:56.484
♪ They don't understand ♪

00:01:56.484 --> 00:02:01.484
♪ And so we're running
just as fast as we can ♪

00:02:01.984 --> 00:02:06.317
♪ Holding on to one another's hands ♪

